{"text":"kuruntokai","n":280,"lines":["கேளிர் வாழியோ கேளிர் நாளுமென்","நெஞ்சுபிணிக் கொண்ட அஞ்சி லோதிப்","பெருந்தோட் குறுமகள் சிறுமெல் லாகம்","ஒருநாள் புணரப் புணரின்","அரைநாள் வாழ்க்கையும் வேண்டலென் யானே"],"tr":["kēḷir vāḻiyō kēḷir nāḷumeṉ","neñcupiṇik koṇṭa añci lōtip","peruntōṭ kuṟumakaḷ ciṟumel lākam","orunāḷ puṇarap puṇariṉ","araināḷ vāḻkkaiyum vēṇṭaleṉ yāṉē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தலைவன் கூற்று","poet_ta":"நக்கீரனார்","speaker_en":"the hero (talaivaṉ)","poet_tr":"Nakkīraṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 17, veṇcīr 2"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"veṇṭaḷai 11, āciriyattaḷai 7"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"கேளிர்","tr":"kēḷir","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கே","tr":"kē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளிர்","tr":"ḷir"}]},{"text":"வாழியோ","tr":"vāḻiyō","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ழியோ","tr":"ḻiyō"}]},{"text":"கேளிர்","tr":"kēḷir","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கே","tr":"kē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளிர்","tr":"ḷir"}]},{"text":"நாளுமென்","tr":"nāḷumeṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ளுமென்","tr":"ḷumeṉ"}]}],[{"text":"நெஞ்சுபிணிக்","tr":"neñcupiṇik","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நெஞ்","tr":"neñ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"சுபி","tr":"cupi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணிக்","tr":"ṇik"}]},{"text":"கொண்ட","tr":"koṇṭa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கொண்","tr":"koṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ட","tr":"ṭa"}]},{"text":"அஞ்சி","tr":"añci","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அஞ்","tr":"añ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"சி","tr":"ci"}]},{"text":"லோதிப்","tr":"lōtip","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லோ","tr":"lō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"திப்","tr":"tip"}]}],[{"text":"பெருந்தோட்","tr":"peruntōṭ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெருந்","tr":"perun"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோட்","tr":"tōṭ"}]},{"text":"குறுமகள்","tr":"kuṟumakaḷ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"குறு","tr":"kuṟu"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மகள்","tr":"makaḷ"}]},{"text":"சிறுமெல்","tr":"ciṟumel","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிறு","tr":"ciṟu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மெல்","tr":"mel"}]},{"text":"லாகம்","tr":"lākam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லா","tr":"lā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கம்","tr":"kam"}]}],[{"text":"ஒருநாள்","tr":"orunāḷ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ஒரு","tr":"oru"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நாள்","tr":"nāḷ"}]},{"text":"புணரப்","tr":"puṇarap","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"புண","tr":"puṇa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரப்","tr":"rap"}]},{"text":"புணரின்","tr":"puṇariṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"புண","tr":"puṇa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரின்","tr":"riṉ"}]}],[{"text":"அரைநாள்","tr":"araināḷ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அரை","tr":"arai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நாள்","tr":"nāḷ"}]},{"text":"வாழ்க்கையும்","tr":"vāḻkkaiyum","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வாழ்க்","tr":"vāḻk"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கை","tr":"kai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யும்","tr":"yum"}]},{"text":"வேண்டலென்","tr":"vēṇṭaleṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வேண்","tr":"vēṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டலென்","tr":"ṭaleṉ"}]},{"text":"யானே","tr":"yāṉē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"கேளிர்","parts":[{"text":"கேளிர்","lemma":"கேளிர்","gloss":"relatives/friends"}],"gloss":"relatives/friends"},{"surface":"வாழியோ","parts":[{"text":"வாழி","lemma":"வாழ்","gloss":"live-optative"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"clitic/vocative particle"}],"gloss":"may you live long!"},{"surface":"கேளிர்","parts":[{"text":"கேளிர்","lemma":"கேளிர்","gloss":"relatives/friends"}],"gloss":"relatives/friends"},{"surface":"நாளும்","parts":[{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"நாள்","gloss":"day"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"every/always"}],"gloss":"every day"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"யான்","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நெஞ்சு","parts":[{"text":"நெஞ்சு","lemma":"நெஞ்சு","gloss":"heart"}],"gloss":"heart"},{"surface":"பிணி","parts":[{"text":"பிணி","lemma":"பிணி","gloss":"binding/fettering"}],"gloss":"binding"},{"surface":"கொண்ட","parts":[{"text":"கொண்ட","lemma":"கொண்ட","gloss":"which took"}],"gloss":"which took","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அஞ்சிலோதி","parts":[{"text":"அம்","lemma":"அம்","gloss":"beautiful"},{"text":"சில்","lemma":"சில்","gloss":"fine/thin"},{"text":"ஓதி","lemma":"ஓதி","gloss":"hair"}],"gloss":"she of the beautiful fine hair"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெருந்தோள்","parts":[{"text":"பெருந்தோள்","lemma":"பெருந்தோள்","gloss":"large shoulders"}],"gloss":"large shoulders","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"குறுமகள்","parts":[{"text":"குறு","lemma":"குறு","gloss":"young/short"},{"text":"மகள்","lemma":"மகள்","gloss":"woman/daughter"}],"gloss":"young woman"},{"surface":"சிறு","parts":[{"text":"சிறு","lemma":"சிறு","gloss":"small/delicate"}],"gloss":"small"},{"surface":"மெல்","parts":[{"text":"மெல்","lemma":"மெல்","gloss":"soft"}],"gloss":"soft"},{"surface":"ஆகம்","parts":[{"text":"ஆகம்","lemma":"ஆகம்","gloss":"chest/bosom"}],"gloss":"chest"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒருநாள்","parts":[{"text":"ஒரு","lemma":"ஒரு","gloss":"one"},{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"நாள்","gloss":"day"}],"gloss":"one day"},{"surface":"புணர","parts":[{"text":"புணர்","lemma":"புணர்","gloss":"embrace/unite"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to embrace"},{"surface":"புணரின்","parts":[{"text":"புணர்","lemma":"புணர்","gloss":"embrace/unite"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"conditional suffix"}],"gloss":"if embracing"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அரைநாள்","parts":[{"text":"அரை","lemma":"அரை","gloss":"half"},{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"நாள்","gloss":"day"}],"gloss":"half a day"},{"surface":"வாழ்க்கையும்","parts":[{"text":"வாழ்க்கை","lemma":"வாழ்க்கை","gloss":"life"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even/also"}],"gloss":"even a life"},{"surface":"வேண்டலென்","parts":[{"text":"வேண்டு","lemma":"வேண்டு","gloss":"want/desire"},{"text":"அல்","lemma":"அல்","gloss":"negation"},{"text":"என்","lemma":"ஏன்","gloss":"first-person singular suffix"}],"gloss":"I do not desire"},{"surface":"யானே","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"யான்","gloss":"I"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"I indeed"}]}],"literal":"O relatives, may you live long, O relatives! Every day my / heart-binding took, she of the beautiful fine hair, / large-shouldered young woman's small, soft chest / one day to embrace, if I embrace, / half a day's life even, I do not desire, indeed.","translation":"May you live long, my friends! If I could embrace, even for a single day, the small, soft chest of that young woman with large shoulders and beautiful, fine hair, who has bound my heart day after day, I would not desire to live even for half a day more.","modern":"என் உறவினர்களே! நீங்கள் வாழ்க! நாள்தோறும் என் நெஞ்சைக் கட்டிப்போட்ட, அழகிய மென்மையான கூந்தலையும் பெரிய தோள்களையும் உடைய அந்த இளம்பெண்ணின் சிறிய மென்மையான மார்பை ஒருநாள் தழுவக் கூடுமானால், அதற்குப் பிறகு அரைநாள் கூட உயிர்வாழ நான் விரும்பமாட்டேன்.","explanation":"The hero speaks to his friends or relatives who are advising him to restrain his intense passion. He declares that his heart has been completely captured and bound day after day by the young woman with beautiful fine hair and large shoulders. He asserts that if he could embrace her small, soft chest for just a single day, he would not wish to live even for half a day after that. This intense longing and desire for union are characteristic of the Kuriñci landscape. The key words are 'kēḷir' (friends/relatives), 'neñcu piṇi koṇṭa' (captured my heart), and 'araināḷ vāḻkkaiyum vēṇṭaleṉ' (I do not want even half a day's life).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.8],[1.8,2.7],[2.7,2.9],[2.9,3.4],[3.4,3.6],[3.6,4.8],[4.8,4.8],[4.8,5.6],[5.67,5.9],[5.9,6.6],[6.6,7.1],[7.1,7.2],[7.2,8.3],[8.3,8.5],[8.5,9.24],[9.43,9.8]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.8],[0.8,1.3],[1.3,2.1],[2.1,2.9],[2.9,3.1],[3.1,3.6],[3.6,3.9],[3.9,5.2],[5.2,5.2],[5.2,6.1],[6.15,6.3],[6.3,7.3],[7.3,7.9],[7.9,7.9],[7.9,9.3],[9.3,9.5],[9.5,10.7],[10.7,11.1]]},"sync":[[["கேளிர்","relatives/friends"]],[["வாழியோ","may you live long!"]],[["கேளிர்","relatives/friends"]],[["நாளும்","every day"],["என்","my"]],[["நெஞ்சு","heart"],["பிணி","binding"]],[["கொண்ட","which took"]],[["அஞ்சிலோதி","she of the beautiful fine hair"]],[["அஞ்சிலோதி","she of the beautiful fine hair"]],[["பெருந்தோள்","large shoulders"]],[["குறுமகள்","young woman"]],[["சிறு","small"],["மெல்","soft"]],[["ஆகம்","chest"]],[["ஒருநாள்","one day"]],[["புணர","to embrace"],["புணரின்","if embracing"]],[["புணரின்","if embracing"]],[["அரைநாள்","half a day"]],[["வாழ்க்கையும்","even a life"]],[["வேண்டலென்","I do not desire"]],[["யானே","I indeed"]]]}